      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riri ndiro neno ra Mwenyezi Mlungu ririromuedzera Jeremia kuamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ima pho ryango ra nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, na utangaze neno hiri, uambe, ‘Sikirani neno ra Mwenyezi Mlungu, mwi mosi a Juda muinjirao maryango gaga kuabudu Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi, Mlungu wa Iziraeli, anaamba, “Rekebishani myenendo yenu nami ndakurichani muishi phapha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msikuluphire maneno higa ga handzo kukala: Ihi ni nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, ni nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, ni nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mchirekebisha njira zenu na mahendo genu na chila mmwenga kumuhendera haki myawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ichikala tamundaonera ajeni, anachiya, magungu au kumwaga mlatso wa atu asio na makosa phatu hipha, na ichikala tamundalunga milungu ya handzo inayo kutiyani hasara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndipho nindakurichani msagale kpwenye tsi ambayo náapha akare enu ta kare na kare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
